 Something come straight to the top of mind?

61
00:02:15,100 --> 00:02:17,180
 I know for me, like that question is easy to answer

62
00:02:17,180 --> 00:02:20,020
 because I remember where I was and when I was,

63
00:02:20,020 --> 00:02:21,580
 when I went to the fanciest party in my life,

64
00:02:21,580 --> 00:02:23,740
 I was 22 years old.

65
00:02:23,740 --> 00:02:24,980
 I was fresh out of college.

66
00:02:24,980 --> 00:02:28,060
 I was in my first job when I got the invitation

67
00:02:28,060 --> 00:02:33,060
 to come to my first company's grand gala,

68
00:02:33,060 --> 00:02:35,780
 which was debuting a brand new office space.

69
00:02:35,780 --> 00:02:37,480
 Like this office space was an office space

70
00:02:37,480 --> 00:02:40,140
 the likes of which you could not imagine.

71
00:02:40,140 --> 00:02:41,340
 It was crazy for me.

72
00:02:41,340 --> 00:02:43,340
 Like it looked like Google just dropped

73
00:02:43,340 --> 00:02:45,580
 right into the middle of College Station in Texas.

74
00:02:45,580 --> 00:02:48,140
 And yet this place was,

75
00:02:48,140 --> 00:02:50,540
 though it was unlike anything I'd ever seen before,

76
00:02:50,540 --> 00:02:52,300
 this is where they decided to have the party.

77
00:02:52,300 --> 00:02:56,020
 And so I show up to this party and I realize like,

78
00:02:56,020 --> 00:02:57,620
 man, I'm not real sure what to expect.

79
00:02:57,620 --> 00:02:58,700
 I know it's gonna be fancy.

80
00:02:58,700 --> 00:03:00,380
 You can't call a party a gala

81
00:03:00,380 --> 00:03:02,180
 without it being a little bit fancy.

82
00:03:02,180 --> 00:03:04,860
 And so I put on a nice suit and I walk out

83
00:03:04,860 --> 00:03:06,620
 and I make sure that I get there on time.

84
00:03:06,620 --> 00:03:08,140
 And as I pull into the parking lot,

85
00:03:08,140 --> 00:03:09,540
 I realized this is not gonna be like any party

86
