1301
00:50:57,540 --> 00:51:02,180
 Kylan, I've been chasing pleasure, man.

1302
00:51:02,180 --> 00:51:05,740
 I've been looking forward in possessions.

1303
00:51:05,740 --> 00:51:08,380
 I've been looking forward in indulgences.

1304
00:51:08,380 --> 00:51:11,100
 I've been looking forward in titles and power and greatness.

1305
00:51:11,100 --> 00:51:14,580
 I've been looking forward in achievements and accolades.

1306
00:51:14,580 --> 00:51:17,260
 I don't wanna chase it anymore.

1307
00:51:17,260 --> 00:51:20,740
 What am I supposed to do?

1308
00:51:20,740 --> 00:51:22,340
 Realize this.

1309
00:51:22,340 --> 00:51:25,740
 He who is of true pleasure, he has chased you.

1310
00:51:25,740 --> 00:51:30,500
 You need only be caught by him tonight.

1311
00:51:30,500 --> 00:51:34,100
 And if you're wondering what's the next step for me to take,

1312
00:51:34,100 --> 00:51:36,780
 my team down to the right, down to the left,

1313
00:51:36,780 --> 00:51:39,500
 they would love to help you process

1314
00:51:39,500 --> 00:51:41,540
 what the best next step is.

1315
00:51:41,540 --> 00:51:44,140
 Every situation in the room's gonna be different.

1316
00:51:44,140 --> 00:51:45,780
 There's not a silver bullet strategy

1317
00:51:45,780 --> 00:51:48,780
 for a room this wide or a people this great,

1318
00:51:48,780 --> 00:51:50,980
 but I promise you by his word,

1319
00:51:50,980 --> 00:51:57,380
 he can tell you a better way forward,

1320
00:51:57,380 --> 00:52:00,420
 a preferred future ahead

1321
00:52:00,420 --> 00:52:02,460
 and the steps you can take here tonight.

1322
00:52:02,460 --> 00:52:05,540
 So let's stand, let's sing, let's take steps.

1323
00:52:05,540 --> 00:52:07,460
 It's in Christ's name we pray, amen.

